#: ../../get_start/corr_2pcf/corr_2pcf.rst:4
msgid ""
"``Corr_2PCF`` evaluates products of filtered data and random fields over "
"a sampled family of separation-binning windows. The same estimator "
"handles isotropic, anisotropic, auto-, and cross-correlations."
msgstr ""

