#: ../../get_start/corr_2pcf/corr_2pcf.rst:191
msgid "Resolution and bin width"
msgstr ""

#: ../../get_start/corr_2pcf/corr_2pcf.rst:193
msgid ""
"The smallest trustworthy scale is controlled jointly by field resolution "
"and the binning window. A narrow bin does not recover structure "
"unresolved by ``J``; a broad bin can intentionally average small-scale "
"variation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../get_start/corr_2pcf/corr_2pcf.rst:197
msgid ""
"The direct periodic pair-counting comparison and its :math:`J` "
"convergence are shown on :doc:`../../benchmark`.  Residual differences "
"are concentrated where the separation approaches the field resolution."
msgstr ""

#: ../../get_start/corr_2pcf/corr_2pcf.rst:202
msgid "Performance controls"
msgstr ""

#: ../../get_start/corr_2pcf/corr_2pcf.rst:204
msgid ""
"Sampling points are distributed across MPI ranks. The dominant cost is "
"one window construction and convolution per sampled bin and required "
"product."
msgstr ""

#: ../../get_start/corr_2pcf/corr_2pcf.rst:207
msgid ""
"``memory_strategy: speed`` keeps reusable fields in memory. ``memory`` "
"reloads or rebuilds more aggressively to reduce peak storage. "
"``binning_window_cache`` can persist expensive kernels across repeated "
"runs; set an explicit ``binning_window_cache_dir`` for production jobs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../get_start/corr_2pcf/corr_2pcf.rst:213
